<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Privacy — The Crawl Price Index</title>
<meta name="description" content="What personal data the Crawl Price Index collects, why, on what legal basis, how long it is kept, and how to exercise your rights.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 viewBox=%270 0 32 32%27%3E%3Crect width=%2732%27 height=%2732%27 fill=%27%230b0d0e%27/%3E%3Crect x=%276%27 y=%2714%27 width=%2720%27 height=%274%27 fill=%27%233cf08a%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,300;6..72,400;6..72,500&family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{--ink:#FBFAF8;--panel:#F2EFE9;--line:#DCD7CE;--dim:#6E6A64;--fg:#14181D;--bright:#14181D;--signal:#1C5D4A}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--fg);font-family:"Newsreader",Georgia,serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6}
  .wrap{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
  a{color:var(--signal)}
  header{padding:44px 0 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .crumb{font-family:"Archivo","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--signal)}
  .crumb a{text-decoration:none}
  h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:500;color:var(--bright);margin:.3em 0 .2em}
  h2{font-size:22px;font-weight:500;color:var(--bright);margin:38px 0 10px}
  .meta{font-family:"Archivo","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:10px}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px}
  th,td{text-align:left;padding:10px 10px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
  th{font-family:"Archivo","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);font-weight:500}
  code{font-family:"Archivo","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--bright);background:#F2EFE9;padding:1px 5px}
  .box{background:var(--panel);border-left:3px solid var(--signal);padding:15px 17px;margin:20px 0}
  ul{padding-left:22px} li{margin-bottom:7px}
  footer{margin-top:52px;padding:22px 0 60px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-family:"Archivo","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--dim)}
</style>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme.css">
</head>
<body class="prose">
<div class="masthead"><div class="wrap">
  <a class="mark" href="/">The Crawl Price Index<b>.</b></a>
  <nav>
